{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "title": "marula chart values",
  "type": "object",
  "description": "The values this chart accepts. Helm ignores a key it does not know, so every object the chart and the control plane write is closed to unknown keys: a misspelled block fails `helm template` instead of silently deploying a default. Blocks the chart does not interpret (secrets, email, object store, observability) stay open because their contents are references, not settings this schema can name.",
